1
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,330
You are not the only one who would trade life for time.

2
00:00:46,120 --> 00:00:47,280
The root you mentioned

3
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:48,480
is this.

4
00:00:51,880 --> 00:00:53,320
If you kill me,

5
00:00:53,320 --> 00:00:55,800
the secret of the unity of Yin and Yang will never be known.

6
00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:57,360
What you pursue is not unity,

7
00:00:57,360 --> 00:00:59,890
but turning all lives into your possessions.

8
00:01:06,720 --> 00:01:10,320
I won't accept this.

9
00:01:12,600 --> 00:01:15,000
This old monster has finally disappeared.

10
00:01:24,120 --> 00:01:25,050
Senior brother.

11
00:01:25,320 --> 00:01:26,280
Your apprentice

12
00:01:26,360 --> 00:01:27,800
is better than my son.

13
00:01:28,480 --> 00:01:29,560
Mo Yun is not bad.

14
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:32,120
You forced him onto the wrong path.

15
00:01:33,800 --> 00:01:35,400
I failed as a father.

16
00:01:36,960 --> 00:01:37,759
Qinghe.

17
00:01:39,120 --> 00:01:41,380
Let him choose his own path in the future.

18
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:43,530
Mo Yun is at Jisheng Clinic.

19
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:45,520
When he wakes up,

20
00:01:45,759 --> 00:01:47,289
he will choose his own path.

21
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:49,890
When the Bagua compass started spinning,

22
00:01:50,240 --> 00:01:51,440
what did you see?

23
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:53,680
Yin and Yang are not two forces,

24
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:55,410
but two sides of the same ruler.

25
00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:57,400
The Yin faction uses it to imprison souls and steal energy,

26
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:59,000
while the Yang faction uses it to prolong life and protect the living.

27
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,460
It depends on your choice.

28
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:01,560
So

29
00:02:01,560 --> 00:02:02,960
that's how it is.

30
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:13,840
All the stolen vitality

31
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:16,280
will now be returned.

32
00:03:02,160 --> 00:03:03,160
The incantation.

33
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:04,890
I deduced it correctly.

34
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:06,560
Not a single word off.

35
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:11,800
After we go back, you can sit as long as you want.

36
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:13,330
Your grandmaster said that

37
00:03:13,640 --> 00:03:15,360
what is carved on the ruler is not just measurements,

38
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,160
but rules.

39
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:17,720
As long as the rules remain,

40
00:03:17,720 --> 00:03:19,180
the craft will not be lost.

41
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:23,210
Let's go.

42
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:23,960
Home.

43
00:03:24,920 --> 00:03:26,040
The apple is too crisp.

44
00:03:26,040 --> 00:03:28,240
It's not a problem with my knife skills.

45
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:32,800
You are so good at crossbows and woodwork,

46
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:34,360
why can't you peel an apple?

47
00:03:36,440 --> 00:03:38,240
Professions have their specialties.

48
00:03:38,240 --> 00:03:39,040
Peeling an apple

49
00:03:39,040 --> 00:03:40,240
is another craft.

50
00:03:44,440 --> 00:03:45,840
How long have you been standing there?

51
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:46,600
Just arrived.

52
00:03:46,600 --> 00:03:47,760
I'm going out for some fresh air.

53
00:03:47,760 --> 00:03:48,960
I peeled that apple.

54
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:49,720
Don't laugh.

55
00:03:59,040 --> 00:04:00,120
You promised me

56
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:01,760
to compile the Mohist techniques and patterns

57
00:04:01,760 --> 00:04:03,890
into a new 'Lu Ban Jing Jiang Jia Jing'.

58
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:05,120
I'll listen to you.

59
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:07,000
I will check the progress regularly.

60
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:07,800
If you do well,

61
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:09,200
I'll treat you to mutton noodles.

62
00:04:09,200 --> 00:04:10,160
No need for ifs.

63
00:04:16,839 --> 00:04:18,240
You can't peel it either.

64
00:04:19,360 --> 00:04:21,160
No one asked me to do this before.

65
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:24,080
Thank you for taking care of

66
00:04:24,080 --> 00:04:25,320
my father's funeral.

67
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:27,400
He probably knew all along

68
00:04:27,400 --> 00:04:28,800
that this day would come.

69
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:32,240
Grandfather said the Mohist school was originally a proper artisan sect,

70
00:04:32,240 --> 00:04:33,970
but later everything changed.

71
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:37,040
I don't know if anyone will remember it in the future.

72
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:37,970
If you remember,

73
00:04:38,159 --> 00:04:39,290
someone remembers.

74
00:05:00,320 --> 00:05:01,650
Apprentice reporting.

75
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:07,930
What should I do?

76
00:05:09,200 --> 00:05:10,400
Use the materials here

77
00:05:10,400 --> 00:05:13,000
to make a Lingshu that can match its breathing.

78
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:14,440
Not to make it obey,

79
00:05:14,640 --> 00:05:16,040
but to let it survive.

80
00:05:28,640 --> 00:05:30,920
The first batch of old Mohist blueprints has been sorted out.

81
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:32,760
Seventy percent are from the previous and old dynasties,

82
00:05:32,760 --> 00:05:34,290
and the rest are even older.

83
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:40,120
The compilation of the new scriptures

84
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,200
can begin.

85
00:06:00,400 --> 00:06:01,260
Sister Wanwan,

86
00:06:01,440 --> 00:06:02,840
this is my newly developed exclusive hidden weapon.

87
00:06:02,840 --> 00:06:04,440
It's for your self-defense.

88
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:06,400
Thank you.

89
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:07,930
You're welcome.

90
00:06:20,640 --> 00:06:21,560
The last line

91
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:23,080
only has three words.

92
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:38,040
It survived.

93
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:39,320
It really stood up,

94
00:06:39,320 --> 00:06:40,760
and it's recovering very fast.

95
00:06:40,760 --> 00:06:41,440
Good job.

96
00:06:41,440 --> 00:06:43,040
Steadier than my first time.

97
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:46,010
What about your first time?

98
00:06:49,520 --> 00:06:51,580
I jammed the Lingshu on the first step

99
00:06:51,960 --> 00:06:53,420
and got scolded by Master.

100
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:01,610
Senior Brother,

101
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:03,880
can the Yin and Yang Yanshi techniques really be combined?
